//@ expect: accept
//@ reason: ext_fn with an int64 parameter and return type (by value) --
//@ reason: confirms `int64` flows through isSupportedExternType/
//@ reason: isPrimitiveType unchanged, since both are type-name-set-driven
//@ reason: rather than enumerating specific primitives. No ext_fn-side code
